Address Word   Instruction       Meaning (all numbers octal)
076000  103100 CLF 0            Disable CPU interrupts
076001  106715 CLC 15           Clear command-channel control once
076002  062005 LDA 076005       Load command pattern
076003  102615 OTA 15           Write command latch; no STC
076004  026002 JMP 076002       Repeat until operator stops
076005  030000 OCT 030000       Seek opcode, drive 0; no seek is started
